<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON ORDER OF PLAY ON SUNDAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON ORDER OF PLAY ON SUNDAY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunday's order of play on Centre</p>
<p>Court at the Wimbledon tennis championships, starting 1300 GMT</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles final</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v Cedric Pioline (France)</p>
<p>Men's doubles final</p>
<p>1-Todd Woodbridge/Mark Woodforde (Australia) v 2-Jacco</p>
<p>Eltingh/Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands).</p>
</text>
